One RTH session with the INSTRUMENT ONLY, read off rolls_steady[] exactly as
today's item 12 was:

  CONFIRMS  a roll with handoff_ms > 5000 whose sig_wait_ms is the same order.
            Then the residual is named, and the one-line fix is justified.
